# EXPECT-SUBSTRING: f-string spec
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
# Format spec f-string ma khong ho tro PHAI bi tu choi, KHONG duoc phat ra
# nguyen van.
#
# Regex f-string truoc day chi khop `{var}` va `{var:.Nf}` nen bat ky spec nao
# khac - `{n:05d}`, `{n:x}`, `{n:+}` - KHONG KHop, ca f-string duoc giu nguyen
# va phat ra nhu chuoi thuong: `f"{n:05d}"` in ra `"{n:05d}"`. Do la sai am
# tham, khong bao gi.
def run() -> "i32":
    n = 42
    print(f"{n:5d}")
    return 0
